%% Diagram 7 - Assessment state machine (pipeline status)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> INTAKE: create (draft or submitted)
  INTAKE --> EVIDENCE_COLLECTION: submit / complete intake
  INTAKE --> CLOSED: withdraw
  INTAKE --> RISK_IDENTIFICATION: fast path
  EVIDENCE_COLLECTION --> CLOSED: admin close
  EVIDENCE_COLLECTION --> RISK_IDENTIFICATION: analysis run succeeded or degraded
  EVIDENCE_COLLECTION --> EVIDENCE_COLLECTION: run failed or unavailable, status unchanged
  RISK_IDENTIFICATION --> INHERENT_RISK_ASSESSMENT: all factors rated, degraded acknowledged
  INHERENT_RISK_ASSESSMENT --> CONTROL_ASSESSMENT: inherent frozen
  CONTROL_ASSESSMENT --> RESIDUAL_RISK: controls mapped or gaps accepted
  RESIDUAL_RISK --> HUMAN_REVIEW: residual frozen, draft generated
  HUMAN_REVIEW --> SUBMITTED_TO_MANAGER: owner submits
  SUBMITTED_TO_MANAGER --> READY_FOR_COMMITTEE: manager approves
  SUBMITTED_TO_MANAGER --> RETURNED_BY_MANAGER: manager returns
  SUBMITTED_TO_MANAGER --> MANAGER_REJECTED: manager rejects
  RETURNED_BY_MANAGER --> SUBMITTED_TO_MANAGER: owner resubmits
  READY_FOR_COMMITTEE --> COMMITTEE_REVIEW: first vote
  COMMITTEE_REVIEW --> APPROVED
  COMMITTEE_REVIEW --> APPROVED_WITH_CONDITIONS
  COMMITTEE_REVIEW --> DEFERRED
  COMMITTEE_REVIEW --> REJECTED
  DEFERRED --> COMMITTEE_REVIEW: reopened
  APPROVED --> CLOSED: no open actions
  APPROVED_WITH_CONDITIONS --> CLOSED: conditions done
  REJECTED --> CLOSED
  MANAGER_REJECTED --> CLOSED
  APPROVED --> REMEDIATION: committee amends
  APPROVED_WITH_CONDITIONS --> REMEDIATION: committee amends
  REJECTED --> REMEDIATION: committee amends
  MANAGER_REJECTED --> REMEDIATION: committee amends
  REMEDIATION --> INTAKE
  REMEDIATION --> RISK_IDENTIFICATION: re-run analysis
  CLOSED --> [*]

  state "INFORMATION_REQUESTED (from any active stage, returns to previous)" as INFO
  HUMAN_REVIEW --> INFO: request info
  INFO --> HUMAN_REVIEW: response provided
